# earring, DM_Earring 14739 (a GM), two Chunks of Light Ore, two sheets of parchment, two bottles of illuminink.
# blank: a light ore traded while available: no trade handler: nothing; no earring held (< NUMBER_OF_DM_EARRINGS 1): 57
# (14739), finished: the quest deleted and begun. Accepted, Prog 0, no ore: 58. Ro'Maeve on day 8000 12:00: a light ore:
# nothing. Day 8022 00:00 (the full moon): a light ore: 8, finished: the Moonlight Ore (npcUtil.giveKeyItem), the ore
# taken; a light ore again (the ore held; not the pair): nothing; the pair: 7, finished: the Ark Pentasphere, the pair
# taken; the pair again: 7, finished: the pentasphere held (rare): giveItem false: nothing taken. Shrine: Prog 0 with the
# ore: 56 (917, 1408, 1550). La'Loff: Invincible (a GM: the five would kill a level 75 Warrior before the last falls), the
# pentasphere at qm1_1, 32000 option 81, the five killed, 32001: battlefieldWin 293 with the ore: Prog 1 (Divine Might's
# own handler: completed, no section). Shrine: 59; update option 2: the earrings; option 0: nothing; 59, update option 1:
# nothing, finish with a full inventory, option 2: nothing; freed: 59, option 2: the Knight's Earring: completed
# (Pentacide Perpetrator), DM_Earring 14740, the ore kept. blank: completed, one earring held: nil: the default.
lists TheShrineOfRuavitau/blank_divine_might/onTrigger Romaeve/QuHau_Spring/onTrade TheShrineOfRuavitau/onEventFinish/57 TheShrineOfRuavitau/onEventUpdate/59 TheShrineOfRuavitau/onEventFinish/59 Romaeve/onEventFinish/7 Romaeve/onEventFinish/8 LaloffAmphitheater/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=TheShrineOfRuavitau pos=-38.533,-1.648,-148.199 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Zilart TheSealedShrine current
quest Outlands.DivineMight completed
charvar DM_Earring 14739
item ChunkOfLightOre x2
item SheetOfParchment x2
item BottleOfIlluminink
item BottleOfIlluminink
login
trade blank_divine_might ChunkOfLightOre x1   # available: no trade handler: nothing
trigger blank_divine_might              # no earring held: 57 (14739)
